{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）與7歲女兒Abi尼泊爾之旅來到尾聲，原定行程因天氣告吹，卻意外迎來驚喜！兩母女 …</p><p></p>\n<p>陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）與7歲女兒Abi尼泊爾之旅來到尾聲，原定行程因天氣告吹，卻意外迎來驚喜！兩母女轉遊猴廟，竟發現尼泊爾版「阿笨與阿占」奇景，Leanne更自爆購物狂基因完美遺傳女兒，究竟Abi的戰利品有幾誇張？<br/>\n</p>\n<h2>行程突變Leanne平常心面對 「慢慢放下腳步」</h2>\n<p>在昨晚（2日）播出的節目中，Leanne與7歲囡囡陳羿辰（Abi）的尼泊爾之旅來到最後一天。原定乘坐小型飛機觀賞野生動物的行程，可惜因天氣不似預期而被迫取消。面對突如其來的變故，Leanne不但沒有失望，反而笑言旅行就是要學懂接受，並向女兒灌輸正面心態：「有時就係咁樣，就算 plan 好晒所有嘢，一個不可預期嘅事情，都會令你計劃改變。不過唔緊要，慢慢放下腳步，就會睇到美麗景色。」她慶幸兩母女心態調整得很快，輕鬆應對旅途上的突發狀況。</p>\n<h2>轉遊猴廟驚見尼泊爾版阿笨與阿占</h2>\n<p>行程更改後，Leanne帶Abi改去參觀加德滿都著名的馬騮寺廟，知道可以近距離接觸動物的Abi顯得非常興奮。廟內的猴子因經常被餵食，所以完全不怕人，更會主動親近遊客。旅程中，Abi更意外發現了尼泊爾版「阿笨與阿占」的奇趣組合，一隻猴子竟悠然自得地騎在狗狗身上，關係非常密切，畫面十分有趣。被問到此行心情時，Abi一臉喜悅地大讚媽咪安排得好：「梗係滿足啦，媽咪好叻呢度又可以睇到雀仔、狗狗同馬騮。」她更直言這天是整個行程中最開心的一天。\n</p>\n<h2>符曉薇自爆購物狂基因 7歲Abi完美遺傳狂掃手信</h2>\n<p>除了與動物作近距離接觸，Leanne在節目中更自爆是天生購物狂，但笑言婚後已有改善。沒想到，女兒Abi卻完美遺傳了她的購物狂基因。在參觀寺廟期間，年僅7歲的Abi化身小富婆，在廟內的市集瘋狂掃貨，對各種飾物、手鏈愛不釋手，甚至連經輪都不放過，買得不亦樂乎，盡顯購物狂本色，讓Leanne哭笑不得。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚Abi可愛 「盡得媽咪真傳」</h2>\n<p>不少觀眾看完節目後都大讚Abi天真可愛，對她遺傳媽咪購物狂基因的反應感到好笑。網民紛紛留言：「馬騮騎住隻狗仔好得意！真係好似阿笨與阿占！」、「7歲就識得掃貨，果然盡得媽咪真傳，哈哈！」、「Leanne心態好好，識得教個女接受突發事，呢啲先係旅行嘅意義。」、「Abi真係好可愛，睇佢買嘢個樣好滿足！」、「呢個旅程好有意義，唔係淨係飲飲食食。」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_189090556ae980b0272c2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_189090556ae980b0272c2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11990219596ae980b8e0a18.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11990219596ae980b8e0a18.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_5180622206ae980c077548.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_5180622206ae980c077548.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_6048928756ae980c7b0ea6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_6048928756ae980c7b0ea6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5319280246ae980cf84f5f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5319280246ae980cf84f5f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_1289596876ae980dbdc886.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_1289596876ae980dbdc886.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_14132501336ae980ec61ec3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_14132501336ae980ec61ec3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_18672017086ae980f79ecc4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_18672017086ae980f79ecc4.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12842643706ae981004e4e2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12842643706ae981004e4e2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%a9%e4%bd%8f%e5%ad%b8%e5%ad%b8%e4%bd%8f%e7%8e%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玩住學學住玩</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%ac%a6%e6%9b%89%e8%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">符曉薇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e7%be%bf%e8%be%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳羿辰</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535142\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊熱話</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:06:25.515782+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1183,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:40:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:50.298771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:00:01.984587+00:00","content_hash":"37bbc55cb908058d6b5246eb775f9fb83a1d9a9edaa5a52dc8bc1384556da540","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error"